{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "reactorguard-data-pipeline",
  "title": "ReactorGuard - Pipeline de datos",
  "description": "Salud del streamer y del consumidor de validacion (Fase 2). Cadencia del TEP: 180 s por muestra; todas las ventanas de rate() son variable.",
  "tags": [
    "reactorguard",
    "fase-2",
    "streaming"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "rate_window",
        "label": "Ventana de rate()",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "1m,5m,15m,1h",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "15m",
          "value": "15m"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "1m",
            "value": "1m"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "5m",
            "value": "5m"
          },
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "15m",
            "value": "15m"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "1h",
            "value": "1h"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Estado actual",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Streamer: mensajes/s",
      "description": "Mensajes publicados en sensor-readings-raw por segundo, media sobre la ventana de rate(). En modo realtime llega un lote de 52 lecturas cada 180 s, asi que el valor medio es pequeno (52/180 = 0,29 msg/s).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(reactorguard_stream_messages_produced_total{topic=\"sensor-readings-raw\"}[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: msg/s",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Consumidor: lecturas/s",
      "description": "Lecturas consumidas del topic raw por segundo (suma de las replicas).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(reactorguard_readings_consumed_total[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: lect/s",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Lag total",
      "description": "Registros pendientes de consumir, sumados por particion (end offset menos posicion). Se toma el maximo por particion entre replicas para no contar dos veces una particion que cambio de dueno. Amarillo por encima de un poll completo (max_poll_records = 500).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max by (partition) (reactorguard_consumer_lag))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Edad del latido",
      "description": "Segundos desde la ultima iteracion del bucle del peor servicio (precision de un intervalo de scrape, 15 s). Amarillo a un intervalo del TEP (180 s: silencio legitimo del streamer en realtime), rojo a staleness_seconds (540 s: /health pasa a 503).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(time() - reactorguard_consumer_heartbeat_timestamp_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 180
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 540
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Throughput",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Streamer: mensajes publicados/s",
      "description": "Mensajes entregados al topic sensor-readings-raw. Un hueco con el streamer vivo indica produce_errors o un productor parado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(reactorguard_stream_messages_produced_total{topic=\"sensor-readings-raw\"}[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "publicados",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: msg/s",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumidor: lecturas consumidas y publicadas/s",
      "description": "Consumidas del topic raw y publicadas en validated y alerts. Con D3 se publican todas las lecturas, asi que consumidas y validated deben coincidir; alerts es una fraccion (kalman_anomaly domina).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(reactorguard_readings_consumed_total[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "consumidas",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(reactorguard_stream_messages_produced_total{topic=\"sensor-validated\"}[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "publicadas en sensor-validated",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(reactorguard_stream_messages_produced_total{topic=\"anomaly-alerts\"}[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "publicadas en anomaly-alerts",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: msg/s",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "consumidas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#2a78d6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "publicadas en sensor-validated"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#1baf7a"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "publicadas en anomaly-alerts"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#eb6834"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Lag por particion",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lag por particion",
      "description": "Registros pendientes por particion, calculado por el propio consumidor tras cada lote. La linea amarilla marca un poll completo (max_poll_records). Un lag que no baja con el consumidor vivo apunta a validacion mas lenta que la entrada.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (partition) (reactorguard_consumer_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "p{{partition}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Calidad y fallos de sensores",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lecturas por quality (por segundo)",
      "description": "Resultado de la validacion de cada lectura. Las lecturas suspect y bad se publican igualmente en sensor-validated (D3); los consumidores posteriores filtran por is_usable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (quality) (rate(reactorguard_readings_validated_total[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{quality}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: lect/s",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "good"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "suspect"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "bad"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "missing"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#898989"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fallos detectados por fault_type",
      "description": "Fallos de sensor acumulados en la ventana de rate() (180 s por muestra). En los runs con fallos de proceso (21 de los 22 ficheros del TEP) bias_out_of_range y stuck dominan el conteo y aplastan al resto: el panel de al lado los separa. kalman_anomaly es senal de apoyo, sin gate.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (fault_type) (increase(reactorguard_sensor_faults_total[$rate_window]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{fault_type}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "stuck"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#2a78d6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "noise_spike"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#eb6834"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "bias_out_of_range"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#1baf7a"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "drift_correlated"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#eda100"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "kalman_anomaly"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#e87ba4"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sensor_drift"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#008300"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fallos menos frecuentes (sin bias_out_of_range ni kalman_anomaly)",
      "description": "Mismos fallos sin los dos detectores de mayor volumen, para que se vean noise_spike, sensor_drift y drift_correlated. bias_out_of_range es un valor fuera del sobre normal (en runs con fallo de proceso es esperable) y kalman_anomaly es senal de apoyo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
